<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC monthly barley data (July/June, million tonnes). * Revisions for 1995/96.</p>
<p>			  96/97 (Dec)    96/97 (Nov)   95/96</p>
